					Sest. 37, 79</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">expositiones brevi interfatione distinguere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 4, 2, 50</span></i>
			 Spald. <i>N. cr.</i></div>
